# OPTIONAL. Copy to .env.testdata (gitignored) only to pin the fixture value the
# suites use. Without this file every suite still runs: the fixture is generated
# at runtime as `fixture-<random uuid>` (see tests/token.test.mjs), so nothing is
# skipped and CI needs no setup.
#
# FIXTURE_VALUE_1 — any opaque string of your choosing. It is used only to
# assert resolveToken's precedence chain and to prove that no persisted artifact
# ever contains it. It is never sent to the network: every test stubs `fetch`.
#
# The variable name is deliberately generic. Names containing `token`, `secret`,
# `key`, `apikey`, or `password` would be flagged by secret scanners on the
# variable alone, which is exactly what this indirection avoids. Do not rename it.
#
# Do NOT put a real GitHub personal access token here. Nothing in the suite needs
# a working credential.
FIXTURE_VALUE_1=replace-me
